In article <4NGDBWWH@math.fu-berlin.de> mac722@cent1.lancs.ac.uk writes:
>First of all, I've completed the Quest and got the Orb of Fate, returned to
>norm, but now I seem to be stuck on the shrine level with norm.  How do I get
>off?  The only solution I can see is to bless a teleport scroll, and thus
>level teleport out.  Is this the only way?  (I don't have many holy waters, so
>I'd rather not do this).
>
First of all, cursing, not blessing, scrolls of teleportation allows
you to teleport (also reading an uncursed scroll of tele confused will
level teleport you).  But anyway, you don't need scrolls of
teleportation to level teleport. Try #invoking the Orb. Second, no,
level teleportation will not transport you back to the Dungeons of
Doom.  Remember where you entered the Home 1 level?  Well, that space
has a magic portal back.  If you don't remember, have fun searching,
because it's your only way back (unless you wish for the Eye of
Anthropica, or whatever the wizard's quest item is called).
